wlanpi-core (2.3.12-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Key wpa_supplicant runtime state by (namespace, interface): the config,
    log and pidfile live under /run/wlanpi-core/wpa/<netns>/ (short enough
    for the control socket path at the longest names), and
