wlanpi-core (2.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add WLAN_MANAGEMENT=auto|manual and GET /system/ntp.
    WLAN_MANAGEMENT lets operators and automation tell core to stop
    managing Wi-Fi interfaces: startup skips network namespace
    initialization and monitor pairs, and activate/deactivate/revert
    return 409. Invalid values fall back to auto so startup is never
    broken.  GET /system/ntp reports systemd-timesyncd clock state
    (synchronized, service, server and source, fallback/runtime servers,
    poll interval).

